      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.76 (down from ₹1.05 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹800.8m (down 19% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹490.9m (down 27% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 61% (down from 68% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 27% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 20% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
